msgctxt "256"
msgid "My goodness, Miki-chan! Patrolling the place all by yourself today, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Y'know how it is. Anything I should know about? Any problems around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"No, we're just fine. Nakahara-san takes good care of us. We never have to "
"worry about a thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Good to hear. You just let me know if something comes up, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "(Hey, Mikio's doing pretty well.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "C'mon, sir! A thorough patrol means we gotta keep moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Okay, on to the next shop..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Hey there, sir. I'm standin' in for the boss on his patrol rounds while "
"he's in the hospital."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "This place gets a whole lot of tourists, so things can get out of hand fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"And hey, it's easy to see how. The food's great, and the booze is even "
"better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Heh, point taken."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Laugh all you want, but this patrol is important enough that the boss does "
"it personally!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Well, keep at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know! Why don't you come with me, sir? You can see how a real Ryudo "
"man gets the job done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "All right. Let's see what you can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"All right, leave it to me! I'll show you a day in the life of an "
"up-and-coming Ryudo man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "All right, come this way. I'll show you around the market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Sorry. Maybe next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay. If you change your mind, come on back. I should still be around "
"here somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "You're not out on your patrol yet, Mikio?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, sir! Good to see you again. Since you're here anyway, want to come "
"with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "You can see a real Ryudo man in action!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "On second thought... I'm gonna have to take a rain check. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Aw, seriously? You got my hopes up! If you change your mind, come on back. "
"I should still be around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Go with Mikio"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Maybe next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Go with Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "On second thought..."
msgstr ""

